convert.assumed|Ground levels (LOCA_GL) of LOCA were written as the third coordinate of a CRS that does not state their vertical datum (3 times).
convert.unmapped-heading|Heading LOCA_PURP of LOCA has no DIGGS target (boreholePurpose is a code list; AGS4 gives free text); not converted (1 value).
convert.user-defined|Heading LOCA_XCOL of LOCA is user-defined (in DICT): reported, never interpreted; not converted (1 value).
convert.assumed|DIGGS requires a lithology classification type, which AGS4 does not state; 'unspecified' was written (3 times).
convert.unmapped-heading|Heading GEOL_GEOL of GEOL has no DIGGS target (a project geology code; its meaning is in the file's ABBR group, not a unit name); not converted (2 values).
