convert.unmapped-heading|Heading GRAG_FINE of GRAG has no DIGGS target (AGS4 fractions use ISO 14688-1 size limits (63 mm, 2 mm, 63 um); the DIGGS 3.0.0 properties use ASTM limits (75 mm, 4.75 mm, 0.075 mm), so the fraction is not converted either way); not converted (1 value).
convert.unmapped-heading|Heading GRAG_GRAV of GRAG has no DIGGS target (AGS4 fractions use ISO 14688-1 size limits (63 mm, 2 mm, 63 um); the DIGGS 3.0.0 properties use ASTM limits (75 mm, 4.75 mm, 0.075 mm), so the fraction is not converted either way); not converted (1 value).
convert.unmapped-heading|Heading GRAG_SAND of GRAG has no DIGGS target (AGS4 fractions use ISO 14688-1 size limits (63 mm, 2 mm, 63 um); the DIGGS 3.0.0 properties use ASTM limits (75 mm, 4.75 mm, 0.075 mm), so the fraction is not converted either way); not converted (1 value).
convert.unmapped-code|Values of GRAT_TYPE in GRAT name a method DIGGS does not tell apart (such as wet or dry sieving); those rows were written as sieve gradings, without the code (2 values).
convert.assumed|Rows of GRAT with no GRAT_TYPE were written as sieve gradings (1 time).
convert.unmapped-code|Rows of GRAT whose GRAT_TYPE names a method with no DIGGS target in the code table (such as a pipette analysis) were not converted (1 row).
convert.unmapped-group|Group HDPH has no mapping to DIGGS; not converted (2 rows).
convert.user-defined|Group XNOT is user-defined (in DICT): reported, never interpreted; not converted (1 row).
